      <p begin="02:07.590" end="02:11.230" ttm:agent="v1">그럼에도 계속해서 kill these waves now</p>
      <p begin="02:11.230" end="02:13.750" ttm:agent="v1">Black swan, 난 black swan, 난 like</p>
